{'symbol': 'EPAM', 'date': '2022-01-11 05:02:00', 'title': "EPAM CONTINUUM APPOINTED STRATEGIC DIGITAL PARTNER FOR LAUNCH OF INEOS AUTOMOTIVE'S NEW GRENADIER VEHICLE", 'text': 'NEWTOWN, PA., JAN. 11, 2022 /PRNEWSWIRE/ -- EPAM CONTINUUM,\xa0THE INTEGRATED BUSINESS, EXPERIENCE, TECHNOLOGY AND DATA CONSULTING PRACTICE OF EPAM SYSTEMS, INC. (NYSE: EPAM), HAS ANNOUNCED A STRATEGIC DIGITAL PARTNERSHIP WITH INEOS AUTOMOTIVE, A SUBSIDIARY OF INEOS GROUP, FORMED TO DEVELOP BEST-IN-CLASS OFF-ROAD VEHICLES.'}